            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A circuit card assembly adapted to be inserted into a conformal shelf assembly, the circuit card assembly comprising: a printed circuit board assembly disposed in a case comprising side faces by which the circuit card assembly is mounted in the conformal shelf assembly, a front facing side disposed between the side faces, and a rear facing side disposed between the side faces opposite the front facing side; and a plurality of ports coupled to the printed circuit board and accessible from the rear facing side of the case.</p>
